ly rail and GND. The footprint should be a capacitor footprint.\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(footprint \\\"Inductor_SMD:L_0805_2012Metric_Pad1.05x1.20mm_HandSolder\\\")\"},\n        {\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"59\\\") (name \\\"unconnected-(C3-Pad1)\\\") (class \\\"Default\\\")\"},\n        {\"source\": \"spice\", \"quote\": \"C3 unconnected-_C3-Pad1_ 0 0.1u\"}\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"The decoupling capacitor does nothing, so the rail it was meant to filter has no local decoupling. The footprint mismatch could also cause a wrong or unfit part at assembly.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.35\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"The netlist shows SKW92A differential transmit pins LAN_PORT3_TX\u00b1 tied to the GND net, which would short a signal pin to ground. A decoupling capacitor C3 is also left with a floating pin and an inductor footprint. The rest of the power, regulator, EPD and SD connections match the specification.\"\n}",
